Package: simtemplate
Title: Parallel Simulation Experiments on a Personal Computer
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Chester", "Ismay", , "chester.ismay@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Randall L.", "Eubank", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Run simulation experiments in parallel on a multicore personal
    computer. Generalizes the 'sim_template' program developed in the book
    "Parallel Simulation Experiments on a Personal Computer" by R. L. Eubank
    and Chester Ismay (CRC Press): a master seed produces one independent
    PCG64 stream per worker process, the replications are divided evenly
    across the processes, and a user-supplied worker function generates the
    data and computes the estimates. Includes the book's example workers
    (estimating pi, the Cauchy interquartile range, and a segmented
    regression bootstrap) and a timing helper for speed-up experiments.
